[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-exchange 4...Nf6"]
[Name "Exchange: 5.Bd3"]

5. Bd3 { The natural square: the bishop looks at h7. }
5... Bg4 { The same rule. The pin on f3 stops the knight going to e5 and keeps it tied to d4. [%cal Gg4f3] }
6. O-O Nc6 { Develops and hits d4 again. [%cal Gc6d4] }
7. c3 { Gives d4 a pawn's support. }
7... e6 { With the bishop out, ...e6 supports d5 and opens the bishop on f8. Next come ...Bd6 and castling. } *
